x="794" y="835"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="aws-e11" value="replicação síncrona" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#232F3E;strokeColor=#C925D1;fontColor=#8A1A90;dashed=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;startArrow=block;startFill=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="rdsa" target="rdsb"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="aws-e12" value="métricas de CPU&lt;br&gt;e scale out/in" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#232F3E;strokeColor=#879196;strokeWidth=1;dashed=1;fontColor=#545B64;fontSize=10;exitX=1;exitY=0.15;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="asg" target="cw"><mxGeometry x="-0.5" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1470" y="599"/><mxPoint x="1470" y="428"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="aws-e13" value="perfil das&lt;br&gt;instâncias" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#232F3E;strokeColor=#879196;strokeWidth=1;dashed=1;fontColor=#545B64;fontSize=10;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.4;" edge="1" parent="1" source="iam" target="asg"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="330" y="662"/><mxPoint x="330" y="655"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n-ha" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Alta disponibilidade na camada web&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• O &lt;b&gt;ALB&lt;/b&gt; tem nós nas 2 AZs e só envia tráfego para instâncias que respondem &lt;b&gt;200&lt;/b&gt; em &lt;b&gt;/api/health&lt;/b&gt; (a cada 15 s; 3 falhas = instância fora de serviço).&lt;br&gt;• O &lt;b&gt;Auto Scaling Group&lt;/b&gt; mantém no mínimo 2 instâncias, uma por AZ. Se uma instância ou uma AZ inteira falha, o ALB passa a usar só a AZ saudável e o ASG cria uma nova instância.&lt;br&gt;• A aplicação é &lt;b&gt;stateless&lt;/b&gt;: todo o estado fica no banco, então qualquer instância atende qualquer requisição.&lt;br&gt;• Um &lt;b&gt;NAT Gateway por AZ&lt;/b&gt;: a saída de cada AZ não depende da outra.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Monitoramento&lt;/b&gt;: dashboard no CloudWatch (requisições, latência, códigos HTTP, instâncias saudáveis por AZ, CPU, DynamoDB) e alarmes de instância com falha e de erros 5xx." style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=12;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#AAB7B8;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1215" width="560" height="265" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n-sg" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Security Groups (menor privilégio)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;sg-alb&lt;/b&gt;: entrada TCP 80 de 0.0.0.0/0&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;sg-app&lt;/b&gt;: entrada TCP 3000 &lt;u&gt;somente&lt;/u&gt; do sg-alb&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;sg-db&lt;/b&gt;: entrada TCP 5432 &lt;u&gt;somente&lt;/u&gt; do sg-app&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;As instâncias EC2 e o RDS ficam em sub-redes &lt;b&gt;privadas&lt;/b&gt;, sem IP público. O acesso administrativo é feito pelo SSM Session Manager, sem porta SSH aberta." style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=12;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#AAB7B8;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="620" y="1215" width="520" height="265" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n-db" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Camada de dados&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;DynamoDB&lt;/b&gt; (padrão): serviço regional, replicado automaticamente em 3 AZs. O acesso passa pelo VPC Gateway Endpoint, sem sair da rede da AWS.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;RDS PostgreSQL&lt;/b&gt; (opcional, &lt;i&gt;DbClient=postgres&lt;/i&gt;): instância primária + standby síncrona em outra AZ (Multi-AZ), com failover automático pelo mesmo endpoint DNS.&lt;br&gt;• O banco é escolhido pela variável &lt;b&gt;DB_CLIENT&lt;/b&gt; no .env das instâncias." style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=12;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#AAB7B8;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1160" y="1215" width="560" height="265" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="app" name="2 - Estrutura da aplicação"><mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="1000" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1480" pageHeight="940" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="t2" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:22px&quot;&gt;Estoque do Supermercado: estrutura da aplicação&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px;color:#545B64&quot;&gt;O que roda dentro de cada instância EC2 do Auto Scaling Group e como as camadas se comunicam&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="15" width="1400" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="nav" value="Navegador do usuário (front-end)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=6;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#666666;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="100" width="330" height="520" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="html" value="&lt;b&gt;public/index.html&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;tela, tabela, formulários (dialog)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="nav"><mxGeometry x="25" y="50" width="280" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="css" value="&lt;b&gt;public/styles.css&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;layout responsivo" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="nav"><mxGeometry x="25" y="130" width="280" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="js" value="&lt;b&gt;public/app.js&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;JavaScript puro&lt;br&gt;fetch() para a API REST&lt;br&gt;painel de resumo, busca, filtros" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="nav"><mxGeometry x="25" y="210" width="280" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="telas" value="&lt;b&gt;Funcionalidades&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• cadastrar / editar / excluir produto&lt;br&gt;• entrada e saída de estoque&lt;br&gt;• busca sem acento e filtros&lt;br&gt;• alertas: estoque baixo e validade" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;spacingLeft=10;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="nav"><mxGeometry x="25" y="320" width="280" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ec2" value="Instância EC2 · Amazon Linux 2023 · serviço systemd &quot;estoque&quot; · Node.js" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=6;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;fillColor=#FDF1E6;strokeColor=#ED7100;fontColor=#9C4A00;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="450" y="100" width="600" height="800" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="server" value="&lt;b&gt;src/server.js&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;lê o .env, inicializa o repositório, sobe o HTTP :3000" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#ED7100;" vertex="1" parent="ec2"><mxGeometry x="30" y="50" width="540" height="55" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="app" value="&lt;b&gt;src/app.js&lt;/b&gt; (Express 5)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=6;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#ED7100;fontColor=#232F3E;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="ec2"><mxGeometry x="30" y="125" width="540" height="330" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="static" value="&lt;b&gt;express.static&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;serve public/" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#FFF7EE;strokeColor=#F5A65B;" vertex="1" parent="app"><mxGeometry x="20" y="35" width="150" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="rotas" value="&lt;b&gt;Router /api&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;GET /api/produtos&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;i&gt;filtros: ?busca= &amp;categoria= &amp;status=&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;GET /api/produtos/:id&lt;br&gt;POST /api/produtos&lt;br&gt;PUT /api/produtos/:id&lt;br&gt;DELETE /api/produtos/:id&lt;br&gt;POST /api/produtos/:id/movimentacoes&lt;br&gt;GET /api/health &lt;i&gt;(health check do ALB)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;GET /api/opcoes" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;spacingLeft=10;fillColor=#FFF7EE;strokeColor=#F5A65B;fontFamily=Courier New;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="app"><mxGeometry x="190" y="30" width="330" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="valid" value="&lt;b&gt;src/validation.js&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;valida e normaliza os campos&lt;br&gt;erro 400 com mensagem por campo" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#FFF7EE;strokeColor=#F5A65B;" vertex="1" parent="app"><mxGeometry x="20" y="115" width="150" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="erros" value="&lt;b&gt;Erros HTTP&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;400 dados inválidos&lt;br&gt;404 não encontrado&lt;br&gt;409 estoque insuficiente&lt;br&gt;500 erro no banco" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#FFF7EE;strokeColor=#F5A65B;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="app"><mxGeometry x="20" y="230" width="150" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="idx" value="&lt;b&gt;src/repositories/index.js&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;escolhe a implementação pela variável &lt;b&gt;DB_CLIENT&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#ED7100;" vertex="1" parent="ec2"><mxGeometry x="30" y="490" width="540" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="rdyn" value="&lt;b&gt;dynamoRepository.js&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;AWS SDK v3 (lib-dynamodb)&lt;br&gt;Scan · Get · Put · Update · Delete&lt;br&gt;saída atômica: ConditionExpression&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;quantidade &amp;gt;= :q&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C925D1;" vertex="1" parent="ec2"><mxGeometry x="30" y="590" width="260" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="rpg" value="&lt;b&gt;postgresRepository.js&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;driver pg (pool de conexões)&lt;br&gt;SQL parametrizado&lt;br&gt;saída atômica: UPDATE ... WHERE&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;quantidade + $2 &amp;gt;= 0&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C925D1;" vertex="1" parent="ec2"><mxGeometry x="310" y="590" width="260" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ddb2" value="&lt;b&gt;Amazon DynamoDB&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;tabela Produtos" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;gradientColor=none;strokeColor=#ffffff;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=#C925D1;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.dynamodb;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1180" y="800" widt